    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manage a link between an <computeroutput>IMP</computeroutput> object and a part of the RMF file. This allows conformations to be loaded flexibly.</para>
<para><ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1rmf_1acb6ac1b816d176053c2a78d3154cf315" kindref="member">LoadLinks</ref> must not save any handles to RMF objects.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Warning: LoadLink has not been stabilized and is likely to change without notice.</title><para></para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
